    <string name="apps_summary_info_title">About Android stats</string>
    <string name="apps_summary_info_body">These numbers come from Android\'s own battery stats. Android starts counting when the phone is unplugged after a full charge, and starts over at the next full charge.\n\nPer-app mAh are Android\'s estimates from its power model, not measurements. Screen on and off show the time and the share of the battery used in each. Doze is the time the phone spent idle with the screen off: deep doze saves the most.\n\nCapacity is Android\'s own estimate of the battery\'s full charge.</string>

