    <string name="apps_details_time_info_title">About time by state</string>
    <string name="apps_details_time_info_body">Foreground is time with the app open on screen. A foreground service keeps working with a notification showing, such as music or navigation.\n\nBackground is time running without either. Cached means Android kept the app in memory, paused, so it opens faster; it uses little battery.</string>

